WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.319 --> 00:00:01.035
- Morning, Quinta.

00:00:01.035 --> 00:00:02.329
- Hey, good morning.

00:00:05.479 --> 00:00:06.890
Well, well, well.

00:00:06.890 --> 00:00:09.531
Look who decided to drink
too much last night.

00:00:09.531 --> 00:00:13.086
Now you gotta hang out
with me, your hangover.

00:00:13.086 --> 00:00:15.548
(laughs) Hi! (laughs)

00:00:17.068 --> 00:00:19.892
Oh, look at you trying
to walk to your desk,

00:00:19.892 --> 00:00:22.026
but you can't 'cause I'm draining

00:00:22.026 --> 00:00:24.301
every single bit of
energy you thought you had

00:00:24.301 --> 00:00:27.088
when you woke up this morning, you idiot.

00:00:29.218 --> 00:00:30.112
- Hey, Quinta.

00:00:30.112 --> 00:00:31.879
- Woah, woah!

00:00:31.879 --> 00:00:34.602
We got a yeller, we
got a yeller, everyone.

00:00:34.602 --> 00:00:35.700
Just kidding.

00:00:35.700 --> 00:00:37.569
I'm giving you a headache
that makes you think everyone

00:00:37.569 --> 00:00:39.600
around you is Gilbert Gottfried.

00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:41.449
(laughs)

00:00:41.449 --> 00:00:43.745
You did this to yourself, you know.

00:00:43.745 --> 00:00:44.802
I wasn't even supposed to be here.

00:00:44.802 --> 00:00:46.284
There was a kid with finals today

00:00:46.284 --> 00:00:48.641
I was gonna bother,
but you asked for this,

00:00:48.641 --> 00:00:49.718
so here I am.

00:00:49.718 --> 00:00:52.217
It all looks like hieroglyphics
to you, doesn't it?

00:00:53.517 --> 00:00:55.123
Why don't you try to
take a walk, you know.

00:00:55.123 --> 00:00:56.321
Maybe walk this one off.

00:00:56.321 --> 00:00:57.824
See if that works.

00:00:57.824 --> 00:00:59.348
You feel better?

00:00:59.348 --> 00:01:00.680
That's cute.

00:01:00.680 --> 00:01:01.878
That's nice.

00:01:01.878 --> 00:01:03.829
That's a sweet miracle.

00:01:03.829 --> 00:01:05.495
Seems too good to be true, doesn't it?

00:01:05.495 --> 00:01:06.754
That's because it is!

00:01:06.754 --> 00:01:07.909
Vomit ray!

00:01:08.989 --> 00:01:10.502
Run to the bathroom!

00:01:10.502 --> 00:01:12.290
(laughs evilly)

00:01:12.290 --> 00:01:14.384
OK, you're clammy, you're clammy.

00:01:14.384 --> 00:01:16.028
You're really, really clammy.

00:01:16.028 --> 00:01:18.283
(laughs) Look at you,

00:01:18.283 --> 00:01:20.884
you're sweating like Donald
Trump at a taco stand.

00:01:20.884 --> 00:01:22.347
I'm having a ball here, people.

00:01:22.347 --> 00:01:23.728
I'm having a good time.

00:01:23.728 --> 00:01:26.126
OK, you've suffered enough.

00:01:26.126 --> 00:01:27.467
Guess I'll go now.

00:01:27.467 --> 00:01:28.422
So I'll catch you next time

00:01:28.422 --> 00:01:31.347
you forget you're an adult
with responsibilities?

00:01:31.347 --> 00:01:32.730
Don't worry about it, alright.

00:01:32.730 --> 00:01:36.284
We'll just make it an impromptu
date out of it, alright.

00:01:36.284 --> 00:01:37.056
Bye!

00:01:37.056 --> 00:01:38.641
I love you.

00:01:38.641 --> 00:01:41.871
Oh, and by the way, you
have a wedding next weekend.

00:01:41.871 --> 00:01:43.883
Just let me know if
you want me to show up,

00:01:43.883 --> 00:01:45.352
the day after, of course.

